  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven statement : 96 * 3 * 7 * 4 * 11 = 15 \n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the * signs :\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : × + ÷ -\n\n96 * 3 * 7 * 4 * 11 = 15 ⇒ 96 × 3 + **7 ÷ 4**__ - 11 = 15 \n\n__**96 **____**× 3**__ + 1.75 - 11 = 15\n\n__**288 + 1.75**__ - 11 = 15\n\n__**289.75**__ - 11 = 15\n\n278.75 ≠ 15 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : × ÷ - + \n\n96 * 3 * 7 * 4 * 11 = 15 ⇒ 96 × **3 ÷ 7**__ - 4 + 11 = 15\n\n__**96 × **____0.42__ - 4 + 11 = 15\n\n__**40.32 + 11**__ - 4 = 15\n\n__**51.32 - 4**__ = 15\n\n47.32 ≠ 15 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : + ÷ × -\n\n96 * 3 * 7 * 4 * 11 = 15 ⇒ 96 + **3 ÷ 7**__ × 4 - 11 = 15\n\n96 + __0.42____** ×**____** 4**__ - 11 = 15\n\n__**96 + **__**__1.68__** - 11 = 15\n\n__**97.68 - 11**__ = 15\n\n82.68 ≠ 15 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : ÷ - × +\n\n96 * 3 * 7 * 4 * 11 = 15 ⇒ **96 ÷ 3**__ - 7 × 4 + 11 = 15\n\n32 - __**7 **____**×**____** 4**__ + 11 = 15\n\n__**32 + 11**__ - 28 = 15\n\n__**43 - 28**__ = 15\n\n15 = 15 (LHS = RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (4)\" is the correct answer.",
